# Async video ingest: output_video copies the frame into a cache entry and appends it to the pending queue.
# The first frame after a (re)start is selected by the next video tick regardless of its timestamp;
# async_active becomes true on ingest; the source's size comes from the async frame (after the first tick).
kind cam input asyncvideo
create c cam C
astate c
size c
video c bgra 4 2 1000 1 171 0
astate c
size c
vtime 100
tick c 0.016
astate c
size c
get_frame c
release_frame c
astate c
